    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Codeflist Block Kit adds a set of native Gutenberg blocks for building common page sections without writing any code. Every block comes with several visual templates you can switch between, plus per-field controls so you can show or hide exactly the content you need.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://demo.codeflist.com/wordpress-plugins/codeflist-block-kit/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Live Demo</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Blocks included</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>FAQ Section</strong> – a frequently-asked-questions accordion with multiple layout templates and per-field show/hide controls.</li>\n<li><strong>Pricing Table Section</strong> – a pricing table with multiple layout templates, currency-aware price display, feature lists, and a highlighted plan.</li>\n<li><strong>Teams Section</strong> – a team members section with multiple layout templates, photo, skills, social links, contact details, and an optional slider.</li>\n<li><strong>Testimonials Section</strong> – a testimonials section with multiple layout templates, an optional slider, and per-field show/hide controls.</li>\n<li><strong>Timeline Section</strong> – a modern timeline section with image, heading, text, and button, available in vertical, horizontal, and classic layouts.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>All blocks are built with the WordPress Block Editor, are fully responsive, and are configured entirely from the block sidebar — no shortcodes or page builders required.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin files to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/codeflist-block-kit</code> directory, or install the plugin through the WordPress Plugins screen directly.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; screen in WordPress.</li>\n<li>Open any post or page in the Block Editor and search for &#8220;Codeflist Block Kit&#8221; (or one of the block names above) in the block inserter.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"do%20i%20need%20to%20know%20how%20to%20code%20to%20use%20these%20blocks%3F\">\nDo I need to know how to code to use these blocks?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>No. Every block is configured visually from the block editor&#8217;s sidebar, including switching between layout templates and toggling which fields are shown.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"can%20i%20customize%20the%20design%20of%20a%20block%3F\">\nCan I customize the design of a block?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. Each block ships with multiple layout templates, and individual fields (images, icons, social links, etc.) can be shown or hidden per block instance.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"will%20these%20blocks%20work%20with%20my%20theme%3F\">\nWill these blocks work with my theme?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Codeflist Block Kit blocks are built on core Gutenberg block support and are designed to be responsive and theme-agnostic. If you run into a display issue with a specific theme, please open a support topic.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release with FAQ, Pricing Table, Teams, Testimonials, and Timeline blocks.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "A collection of responsive Gutenberg blocks — FAQ, Pricing Table, Team, Testimonials, and Timeline — each with multiple ready-to-use templates.",
    "description": "<p>Codeflist Block Kit adds a set of native Gutenberg blocks for building common page sections without writing any code. Every block comes with several visual templates you can switch between, plus per-field controls so you can show or hide exactly the content you need.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://demo.codeflist.com/wordpress-plugins/codeflist-block-kit/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Live Demo</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Blocks included</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>FAQ Section</strong> – a frequently-asked-questions accordion with multiple layout templates and per-field show/hide controls.</li>\n<li><strong>Pricing Table Section</strong> – a pricing table with multiple layout templates, currency-aware price display, feature lists, and a highlighted plan.</li>\n<li><strong>Teams Section</strong> – a team members section with multiple layout templates, photo, skills, social links, contact details, and an optional slider.</li>\n<li><strong>Testimonials Section</strong> – a testimonials section with multiple layout templates, an optional slider, and per-field show/hide controls.</li>\n<li><strong>Timeline Section</strong> – a modern timeline section with image, heading, text, and button, available in vertical, horizontal, and classic layouts.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>All blocks are built with the WordPress Block Editor, are fully responsive, and are configured entirely from the block sidebar — no shortcodes or page builders required.</p>\n",
